NOTE ON DATA AND IMAGERY

The imagery under `public/imagery/` is derived from third-party sources that
carry their own terms; see `docs/SOURCES.md` for per-dataset attribution.
NASA Blue Marble Next Generation and USDA NAIP are US federal works, not
subject to copyright in the United States. MassGIS imagery is redistributed
under the Commonwealth of Massachusetts EOTSS terms, which request
acknowledgement. Building footprint data comes from Harvard PPM, Cambridge
GIS, MassGIS, OpenStreetMap (ODbL) and Microsoft GlobalMLBuildingFootprints
(ODbL). The MIT licence above covers this project's own code and content, not
these upstream datasets.

This is not a Harvard product and is not affiliated with or endorsed by
Harvard University.
